          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Tekton is a Michigan company that makes most of its tools in Taiwan, a growing share in its own U.S. facilities, and a small number in Germany, Canada and elsewhere in Europe. It tells you which is which on every product page, which is more than most brands at any price will do. If origin matters to you, that origin line and the marking on the tool are the only sources worth trusting.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            For everyone else, the more important fact is the warranty: no receipt, no time limit, coverage for any owner, and free replacements that often ship the same day. Pay for torque wrench calibration as maintenance, buy from Tekton.com or a known dealer to avoid fakes, and start with the picks in our <a href="/best-tekton-hand-tools/">best Tekton hand tools guide</a>.
